  "block.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger":  "Container Fluid Exchanger",
  "tooltip.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger":  "Left slot: an oil bucket / gas tank with fluid in it. Right slot: exactly 1 empty bucket\nAfter 3 s it takes 1000 mB out and turns that empty bucket into the bucket of that fluid (water -> water bucket, diesel -> diesel bucket; fluids from other mods work too, as long as they have a bucket of their own)\nFluids without a bucket form (crude oil / naphtha / LPG) are refused\nFor gases (gas tank) hook a fluid pump to this block: the pump drains the container in the left slot directly, as much as there is",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.empty":  "[Fluid Exchanger] Left slot is empty (or the container holds nothing)",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.invalid":  "[Fluid Exchanger] The left slot does not hold a fluid container - use an oil bucket or a gas tank",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.output_full":  "[Fluid Exchanger] The right slot needs exactly 1 empty bucket - it turns into that fluid's bucket in place",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.running":  "[Fluid Exchanger] Exchanging (3 s / 1000 mB)",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.material":  "[Fluid Exchanger] Less than 1000 mB in the left container - it resumes as soon as there is enough",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.no_bucket":  "[Fluid Exchanger] This fluid has no bucket form (crude oil / naphtha / LPG live only in oil buckets)",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.gas":  "[Fluid Exchanger] The left slot holds a gas - the GUI does not handle gases, hook up a fluid pump",
  "block.potato_s_t.asphalt_block":  "Asphalt Block",
